- Facts an agent must never assume:

## Claim-safety notes

Mark evidence as confirmed, context-supported, or requiring confirmation. Do not include passwords, access tokens, private account credentials, or unrelated sensitive information. Do not include an item in an application unless it is relevant to that specific role.
